  "definition": "Description of Forms A and B",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-02-02",
  "historyNote": "#1900, eff 1-1-82; ss by #2441, eff 1-1-84; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5650, eff 7-1-93, EXPIRED 7-1-99 New. #7146, eff 4-1-00, EXPIRED: 4-1-08 New. #9611, eff 1-4-10; ss by #12474, eff 2-2-18",
